{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"My dear Marie,\n\nWe spent the night in Flamen Hoofd. The road here is paved like the Kings Road in Berlin, shaded by trees, and winds through fields, gardens, and meadows. It is a different world than around Aachen or Liège. We did not see a single beggar.\n\nThe children in the village all wore shoes, many of them made of wood, and stockings. We passed a village with fifteen thousand inhabitants. Everything appears orderly and possessing. I looked at the people's clothing; it is clean and smart. Nothing is lacking. The air is fresh, and I slept well, which was very beneficial to me after this long journey.\n\nI will continue my journey tomorrow. Just let me know how the boys are doing.\n\nYour\nG. W. F. Hegel"}}],"created":1795221116,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":168,"prompt_tokens":257,"total_tokens":425,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-8YP723KlW2ba2GStpbbwYpKtNFmjrhE8","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":257,"prompt_ms":436.397,"prompt_per_token_ms":1.6980428015564202,"prompt_per_second":588.9133060034785,"predicted_n":168,"predicted_ms":3875.887,"predicted_per_token_ms":23.208904191616767,"predicted_per_second":43.08691146052503}}